cade! Spawning the monster hit anime TV series of the same name, Attack on Titan has become a pop culture sensation.\nL41: ## Series\nL42: Info\nL43: \nL44: ### Status\nL45: \nL46: Complete\nL47: \nL48: ### Rating\nL49: \nL50: 16+\nL51: \nL52: ### Formats\nL53: \nL54: Print & Digital\nL55: \nL56: ### Resources\nL57: \nL58: 【14†MyAnimeList†myanimelist.net】\nL59: \nL60: ### Tags\nL61: \nL62: 【15†Made into Anime】【16†Horror】【17†Science-Fiction】\nL63: \nL64: ## Read free chapter preview\nL65: \nL66: Attack on Titan Volume 1 · Chapter 1\nL67: \nL68: Report\nL69: \nL70: ## First Volume\nL71: \nL72: Attack on Titan\nL73: ### 【18†Volume 1】\nL74: In this post-apocalyptic sci-fi story, humanity has been devastated by the bizarre, giant humanoids known as the Titans. Little is known about where they came from or why they are bent on consuming mankind. Seemingly unintelligent, they have roamed the world for years, killing everyone they see. For the past century, what’s left of man has hidden in a giant, three-walled city.\nL75: People believe their 100-meter high walls will protect them from the Titans, but the sudden appearance of an immense Titan is about to change everything. Winner of the 2011 Kodansha Manga Award (Shonen) and nominated for the prestigious Osamu Tezuka Cultural Prize for 2012.\nL76: 【18†more details】\nL77: \nL78: Read now for $3.99\nL79: \nL80: [Button: Add To Cart ] 【19†Shop Retail Partners】\nL81: ## Most Recent Volume\nL82: \nL83: Attack on Titan\nL84: ### 【20†Attack on Titan 35: FLY Collector's Box Set】\nL85: That was not the end! This super-premium collector’s set includes a colossal color art book with an original interview with creator Hajime Isayama, replicas of Eren’s key and Mikasa’s scarf, and, for the first time, the exclusive manga booklet Vol. 35.\nL86: The ultimate addition to every collection, Attack on Titan: FLY is coming to the world in English! This huge box set, previously only available in Japan in limited quantities, includes the final, 216-page Attack on Titan art book, featuring every color illustration known to man (or Titan!) and an exclusive new interview with Hajime Isayama, housed in a beautiful slipcase, alongside bonuses fans are going to love, like a full-sized replica set of the manuscript pages of the last chapter of Attack on Titan; the padlock and key housing the secrets behind the basement of Eren’s family home; the scarf Eren gave to Mikasa; and, most exciting of all, the exclusive manga “Volume 35,” a new chapter of manga focused on fan-favorite Levi, plus the rough layouts of the final chapter, all presented for the first time in English!\nL87: 【20†more details】\nL88: \nL89: 【21†Shop Retail Partners】\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVIZ | The Official Website for Death Note (https://www.viz.com/death-note)\nciteturn2view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.viz.com/death-note\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 302\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: ## Manga & Anime Favorites\nL3: \nL4:   * 【1†Ito-verse】\nL5:   * 【2†Black Torch】\nL6:   * 【3†Naruto】\nL7:   * 【4†Jujutsu Kaisen】\nL8:   * 【5†Pokémon】\nL9:   * 【6†Bleach】\nL10:   * 【7†Read Free Manga!】\nL11:   * 【8†Gomi】\nL12: \nL13: #\nL14: \nL15: Menu\nL16: \nL17: 【9†Image†dw9to29mmj727.cloudfront.net】\nL18: \nL19: 【10†SHONEN JUMP】 【11†Action-Adventure】 【12†Drama】 【13†Mystery】 【14†Supernatural】 【15†Thriller】\nL20: \nL21: Jump to:\nL22: \nL23:   * 【16†Manga & Books】\nL24:   * 【17†Anime】\nL25:   * 【18†Series】\nL26: ## Death Note\nL27: \nL28: When Light Yagami finds a notebook giving him power over death, will he use it for good—or evil?\nL29: \nL30: Created by Tsugumi Ohba and Takeshi Obata | 【19†More Less about Death Note】\nL31: Light Yagami is an ace student with great prospects—and he’s bored out of his mind. But all that changes when he finds the Death Note, a notebook dropped by a rogue Shinigami death god. Any human