two brothers, Edward and Alphonse Elric, dabbled in this power to grant their dearest wish, one of them lost an arm and a leg…and the other became nothing but a soul locked into a body of living steel. Now Edward is an agent of the government, a slave of the military-alchemical complex, using his unique powers to obey orders…even to kill. Except his powers aren't unique.\nL39: The world has been ravaged by the abuse of alchemy. And in pursuit of the ultimate alchemical treasure, the Philosopher's Stone, their enemies are even more ruthless than they are…\nL40: 【18†Buy now】\nL41: ### Other Fullmetal Alchemist volumes\nL42: \nL43: 【19†See all >】\nL44: \nL45: Manga\nL46: \nL47: 【20†Fullmetal Alchemist (3-in-1 Edition), Vol. 1】\nL48: \nL49: Manga\nL50: \nL51: 【21†Fullmetal Alchemist Complete Box Set】\nL52: \nL53: Series Debut!\nL54: \nL55: Manga\nL56: \nL57: 【22†Fullmetal Alchemist: Fullmetal Edition, Vol. 1】\nL58: \nL59: Manga\nL60: \nL61: 【23†Fullmetal Alchemist: The Complete Four-Panel Comics】\nL62: \nL63: 【19†See all >】\nL64: ### Check out Fullmetal Alchemist art books, novels and other special releases\nL65: \nL66: 【24†See all >】\nL67: \nL68: Book\nL69: \nL70: 【25†Fullmetal Alchemist 20th Anniversary Book】\nL71: \nL72: Novel\nL73: \nL74: 【26†Fullmetal Alchemist: The Ties That Bind】\nL75: \nL76: Novel\nL77: \nL78: 【27†Fullmetal Alchemist: Under the Faraway Sky】\nL79: \nL80: Novel\nL81: \nL82: 【28†Fullmetal Alchemist: The Valley of White Petals】\nL83: \nL84: 【24†See all >】\nL85: ### If you like Fullmetal Alchemist, VIZ Editors recommend:\nL86: \nL87: 【29†See all >】\nL88: \nL89: 【30†Arata: The Legend】\nL90: \nL91: 【31†Dragon Quest】\nL92: \nL93: 【32†Bug Ego】\nL94: \nL95: 【33†Dr. STONE】\nL96: \nL97: 【29†See all >】\nL98: \nL99: 【34†Image†dw9to29mmj727.cloudfront.net】\nL100: \nL101: ### Get the latest manga & anime news!\nL102: \nL103: You’ll never miss a beat when you subscribe to our newsletter.\nL104: \nL105: [Input: Enter your email address] [Button: Sign Up]\nL106: #